0px)"/><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0611/9204/4732/files/DailyPerformanceGummies_AmazonATFCarousel_3.png?v=1741379490" alt="Green packaging of daily performance gummies with natural ingredients, promoting convenience and dietary suitability." class="r-n5wicy" loading="eager"/></picture></div><div data-rid="0e48eea3-1fbe-4b3e-aad5-af328d2ab3c8" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0" class="r-hmdw8f"><div data-rid="c0a5c30e-ee13-4839-8288-0c2a6bd0831f" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0" class="r-49x92a"><picture data-rid="9fcaa57f-e7d7-4447-a672-b45925256d1d" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0" class="r-poufja"><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0611/9204/4732/files/Infographic_HowDoesCreatineWork_GreenBG-min.webp?v=1739201540&amp;width=820" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0611/9204/4732/files/Infographic_HowDoesCreatineWork_GreenBG-min.webp?v=1739201540&amp;width=1024" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0611/9204/4732/files/Infographic_HowDoesCreatineWork_GreenBG-min.webp?v=1739201540&amp;width=1800" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0611/9204/4732/files/Infographic_HowDoesCreatineWork_GreenBG-min.webp?v=1739201540" alt="Illustration explaining how creatine aids in ATP energy recovery during muscle contraction." class="r-teqy33" loading="eager"/></picture></div><div data-rid="fd2b12bf-bf74-4bee-8067-f6d42943f291" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0" class="r-1u7j2tj"><div data-rid="c3b3de4a-b098-43cd-96ec-45141e3fb57d" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0" class="r-l3wcwj alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>2. Creatine gives you more energy throughout your day.</p></span></div><div data-rid="682c8c03-e208-4c5e-8eed-eef644fcbc80" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0" class="r-ndhdjh alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Creatine's core function is increasing the production of ATP, the most basic form of energy in your body's cells. <strong>ATP plays a crucial role in metabolism and muscular function in particular.</strong></p><br><p>Whether you're looking to stay focused throughout your workday, aiming to hit that next level in a workout, or you need more energy to enjoy time with friends and family, <strong>creatine can support you across all of your goals.</strong></p></span></div></div></div><div data-rid="881ebf53-44ce-4f95-a365-e7e33546fb5f" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0" data-alchemy-url-hashmark="influencers" tabindex="-1" id="influencers" data-alchemy-url-hashmark-ignore="true" class="r-t8p8gk"><div data-rid="cf05c791-f868-4579-9c27-2e3355ba95ca" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0" class="r-1xnw4fi"><div data-rid="344b9532-31ea-4262-9ba9-10331abe32f6" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0" class="r-1asxzsp alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>3. Creatine can be even more beneficial for women than men.</p></span></div><div data-rid="64ac1074-eb39-41ae-bc32-3b2718103838" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0" class="r-crvmj alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Most people think of creatine as something used by huge male bodybuilders to pop their pecs and boost their biceps, but <strong>creatine can actually be even more powerful and effective for women</strong>. At a basic level, you can <strong>accelerate those glute gains</strong>, but other improvements to focus and energy may help women dealing with hormonal shifts and facing broader fatigue.<br><br>Creatine also <strong>helps with muscle recovery and has huge benefits for bone density and joint health</strong> - women naturally have lower bone density than men, so paying extra attention to this area is important at all stages of life.<br><br>Taking creatine at levels under 10g per day also carries<strong> little to no risk of bloating - get that energy and those gains without feeling puffy!</strong></p></span></div></div><div data-rid="79152f